# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:3
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_f7213481:

    # "Markus’ house was only slightly smaller than mine but felt much more cramped."
    "マーカスの家は私の家よりほんの少しだけ小さいが、ずっと狭く感じられた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:4
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_8d7cfe15:

    # "Littered about the place were various strange and extraordinary items his brother had collected over the years that clogged up much of the space, hence why me and Markus spent less time here growing up."
    "場所には、兄が長年にわたって集めた様々な奇妙な物品が散らばり、多くの空間を塞いでいたため、マーカスと私は成長期にはここで過ごす時間をあまり持たなかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:9
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_209c6d2f:

    # "Entering through a door open ajar, I've realized that I walked into what could be described as a family conversation:"
    "少し開いたドアから中へ入ると、それは家族の会話と呼べるような光景だった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:11
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_340883f3:

    # "It was Skallion, Markus' brother."
    "スカリオンだった、マルクスの弟だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:12
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_d6aaf9ed:

    # "Having lost both of his parents during the war, Skallion, who used to live alone, was forced to take the young Markus under his wing."
    "戦争で両親を失い、一人暮らしをしていたスカリオンは、幼いマルクスを引き取らざるを得なくなった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:13
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_00a28245:

    # "He was taller and more muscular than both of us has been before we joined the Scouts, but now we towered over him."
    "彼は、我々がスカウトに入る前の二人よりも背が高く、筋肉質だったが、今では我々がはるか背が高くなっている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:15
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_ba816de9:

    # SKALLION "What I'm saying is, Markus..."
    SKALLION "つまり、マーカス…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:17
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_447fd455:

    # SKALLION "Bah!"
    SKALLION "ふん!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:18
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_fbc49fa5:

    # SKALLION "Not you too!"
    SKALLION "あんたまで!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:20
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_56169cb1:

    # SKALLION "What have they been feeding the two of you?!"
    SKALLION "一体、あの二人に何を食べさせてるんだ？!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:21
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_85613c44:

    # MC @ talk "U-Uhhh, plenty of meat?"
    MC @ talk "あ、あの…お肉がいっぱい？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:22
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_de517d45:

    # SKALLION "Some bloody good meat..."
    SKALLION "なかなかの肉だ…最高にうまい…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:23
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_3e325f63:

    # SKALLION "Anyway, you two should go to the Adventurers Guild now."
    SKALLION "とにかく、二人は今すぐ冒険者ギルドに行ったほうがいい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:24
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_274ddbfe:

    # SKALLION "Try not to get into any trouble on your way there."
    SKALLION "行く途中で、トラブルに巻き込まれないようにね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:25
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_ef6ac64b:

    # "Skallion nodded briefly in my direction."
    "スカリオンは軽く私の方へうなずいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:27
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_dbd12c1a:

    # SKALLION "Try and stop Markus from getting too drunk, if that’s even possible."
    SKALLION "マーカスが飲みすぎないように気をつけて。もしやれるならば。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:28
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_3e187933:

    # MARKUS "Urgh, I’m not a child anymore you know."
    MARKUS "もう、子供じゃないんだから。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:29
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_aff511e7:

    # SKALLION "I know I know..."
    SKALLION "分かってる、分かってる…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:30
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_393000c5:

    # SKALLION "You’re an OVERGROWN child with a drinking problem."
    SKALLION "あなたは育ちすぎた子供で、アルコール問題を抱えている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:31
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_9c42a8b9:

    # "Markus pulled an unimpressed expression as Skallion snickered to himself."
    "スカリオンがくすくす笑っている一方で、マーカスは冷めた表情を浮かべた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:32
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_6eef8ce4:

    # SKALLION "Oh, and don’t disturb me in my room plase..."
    SKALLION "あ、それと部屋には来ないでね…お願いだから"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:33
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_8a710b07:

    # SKALLION "I’m working on a little project."
    SKALLION "小さなプロジェクトをやっているんだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:34
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_2e478c4d:

    # MARKUS "Is this another one of your secret projects?"
    MARKUS "これはまた君の秘密のプロジェクト？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:35
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_d6f4eb56:

    # SKALLION "{i}Perhaps.{/i}"
    SKALLION "{i}たぶん。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:36
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_b2eb23c8:

    # MARKUS "Will we ever see one of these secret projects of yours?"
    MARKUS "あなたの秘密のプロジェクト、いつか見られるのかな？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:37
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_2af2a567:

    # SKALLION "When it’s done, of course!"
    SKALLION "終わったら、もちろんよ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:38
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_78403189:

    # MARKUS "...Will it {i}ever{/i} be done?"
    MARKUS "...{i}いつ{/i}になったらできるんだろう？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:39
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_b89fc0b4:

    # SKALLION "Such little faith you have, younger brother."
    SKALLION "ちっとも信じてくれないんだね、弟よ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:40
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_bfb62c86:

    # SKALLION "I promise you, when this is done, we’ll be swimming in gold."
    SKALLION "約束する、これが終わったら、我々は金の海を泳ごう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:41
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_4295ca1f:

    # MARKUS "For that I cannot wait!"
    MARKUS "待ちきれないわ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:43
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_77459e11:

    # "Skallion smirked to himself as he headed back into his room, closing the door firmly behind him."
    "スカリオンは一人で薄笑いを浮かべ、自室へと戻ると、後ろでドアをしっかりと閉めた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:44
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_136008ab:

    # "Markus nodded and motioned for me to come into his room."
    "マルクスはうなずくと、自分の部屋へと手招きした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:51
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_ef0e71b9:

    # "The room was smaller than mine, little more than box really with just two shelves and a chest."
    "部屋は私のより狭く、実際には棚が二つと箱一つしかない、箱程度の大きさだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:52
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_d96e4bf4:

    # "His room used to be a place Skallion stored things before the young Markus abruptly arrived."
    "スカリオンの部屋は、かつて物置部屋だったが、若いマルクスが突然訪れることになった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:54
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_6994bdf6:

    # "Grabbing the small pouch from the shelf, Markus turned to dangle it in front of me."
    "棚から小さな袋を手に取ると、マーカスは振り返り、それを私の目の前でぶら下げた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:55
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_e94e0fb2:

    # "I heard the rustle of coin inside."
    "中からコインが触れ合う音が聞こえた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:56
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_98fb41e8:

    # MARKUS "Say hello to tonight's entertainment."
    MARKUS "今宵のお楽しみにご挨拶を。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:58
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_c96f0405:

    # MC @ talk "No, nevermind me, I'm just estimating the amount of effort it will take to stop you from drinking this all up."
    MC @ talk "いや、気にしないで。君がこれを全部飲み干すのを止めるのに必要な労力を見積もっているだけさ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:59
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_8dca3bcc:

    # MARKUS "Haha! No, I'm not really in the mood for getting {i}too drunk{/i} now..."
    MARKUS "はは!いや、今はあまり{i}酔っ払う{/i}気分じゃないんだ…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:60
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_1ba5839d:

    # MARKUS "Ever since the... The thing happened."
    MARKUS "その…...
出来事があって以来ずっと。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:61
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_cef1ea26:

    # "An eerie silence enveloped the room as we involuntarily recalled bits and pieces of the events at the fort."
    "不気味な沈黙が部屋を包んだ、俺たちは砦での出来事を記憶の断片から否応なく呼び起こしていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:62
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_ba56ef01:

    # "I broke the silence with a probing question:"
    "沈黙を破ったのは、私の探るような質問だった："

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:63
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_f17dba09:

    # MC @ talk "Say Markus, what do you remember about what happened to us?"
    MC @ talk "マーカスや、俺たちに何が起きたか覚えてるか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:64
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_8f28c026:

    # MARKUS "*Sigh* Must we do this now?"
    MARKUS "*ふう* 今やらなきゃダメ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:65
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_82e23bb3:

    # MARKUS "I’d rather have a pint of ale or two first."
    MARKUS "先にエールを一杯、いや二杯飲みたいな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:66
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_c1be730c:

    # MC @ talk "I just need to know."
    MC @ talk "知りたいだけだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:67
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_68b4cda3:

    # MC @ talk "Have you been hearing voices?"
    MC @ talk "声が聞こえてきていますか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:68
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_6229010b:

    # "Markus paused uncomfortably as his face turned sullen and uneasy."
    "マルクスは不快に立ち止まり、顔が陰鬱で落ち着かない表情へと変わった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:69
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_88e4876b:

    # MARKUS "... Yes."
    MARKUS "……ええ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:70
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_c3f1a405:

    # MC @ talk "What did the voice say?"
    MC @ talk "その声は何と言った？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:71
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_4ea298cc:

    # MARKUS "That it was here to help, that it had saved me."
    MARKUS "それが助けに来てくれたこと、私を救ってくれたことなのだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:72
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_17a55499:

    # MARKUS "I would really rather not think—"
    MARKUS "考えるのは本当にやめたい——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:73
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_d675b20e:

    # "Suddenly, Markus’ eyes widened in surprise as he stumbled backwards clumsily, shock etched on his face."
    "突然、マーカスの目が驚きを見開き、よろよろと後ずさった。顔には衝撃が走っている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:74
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_19524cd6:

    # MC @ talk "... Markus?"
    MC @ talk "…マーカス？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:75
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_178c19a8:

    # "Turning pale white, Markus collapsed, but his hand reached out to grab onto one of the shelves, dragging everything off from it in one clean sweep as he fell backwards onto his bed."
    "真っ青になって、マルクスは崩れ落ちたが、その手は棚の一つに掴みかかって、背中からベッドに倒れ込む際、そこにあるものを一掃してしまった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:76
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_8362d5b0:

    # MC @ talk "Markus!"
    MC @ talk "マルクス!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:78
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_d87a50e5:

    # "Stepping forward to help him, I suddenly felt an intense burning heat within my chest, like my lungs were filling with ash."
    "彼を助けようと歩み出した途端、胸の内側が強く焼けつくように熱く、まるで肺に灰が溜まっていくようだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:84
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_d7341b8a:

    # "Something began to swirl and froth inside of me, I could feel it moving under my skin, stretching and splitting me."
    "何かが私の中で渦巻き、泡立つように動き始めた。皮膚の下でそれが蠢き、私を伸ばして裂いてゆくのを感じた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:85
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_45c57fa0:

    # "Frantically, the two of us began to pull off our clothes to see what horror was beneath, we found a hot mass swelling on both of our chests, Markus’ white, mine black."
    "必死に服をかきむしり、その下にある恐怖を確かめると、二人の胸には熱い塊が盛り上がっていた。マーカスのそれは白く、私のは黒かった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:89
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_bbb10b86:

    # "We looked to each other, frozen in terror."
    "私たちは恐怖に凍りつき、互いを見つめ合った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:90
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_39b6c7fa:

    # "Before we could say anything, they moulded and took form; extending out of our bodies, the two liquids coiled around each other."
    "何も言えぬうちに、それらは形を成していった。我々の体から伸びて、二つの液体は互いに絡み合った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:91
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_e87013db:

    # "What appeared to be their heads now became bug-like in appearance with sharp pincers extending out of them as the creatures looked quizzically at each other before gradually retreating."
    "彼らの頭部は今や虫のような外見へと変わり、鋭い鋏がその先から伸びていた。それらの生物は互いに首をかしげて見つめ合うと、徐々に後退していった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:92
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_fa6b4545:

    # "My heart stopped, I thought that at any moment these things that were inhabiting our bodies were going to split through our skin and kill us in some wretched, macabre display of violence."
    "心臓が止まったかと思った。今にも、この体に巣食うものが皮膚を破り、惨めで不気味な暴力の形で私たちを殺すんじゃないかと。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:93
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_ea0bfa1f:

    # "We both looked at each other, half in disbelief, half in terror."
    "私たちはお互いの顔を見合わせ、半信半疑で、そして恐怖にかられていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:94
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_4ed832ba:

    # "Now angled towards us, the things looked us dead in the eye and turned their strange heads inwards in curiosity."
    "こちらに向けられた今、それらは真っ直ぐに視線を合わせて、奇妙な首を内側に傾け、好奇心に満ちた様子だった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:95
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_e1050380:

    # "Then... {i}they spoke without mouths{/i}."
    "そして… {i}口も動かさずに彼らは話した{/i}。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:96
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_66bfe193:

    # BLACK "{i}Hello...{/i}"
    BLACK "{i}こんにちは…{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:97
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_652e3355:

    # "Me and Markus shared a look of panic as we waited for what came next."
    "俺とマーカスは、次に何が起こるか待ちながら、パニックの色を浮かべて顔を見合わせた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:98
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_b70c4b70:

    # WHITE "{i}Do not be alarmed.{/i}"
    WHITE "{i}驚かないで{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:99
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_e54e64e2:

    # BLACK "{i}You are our hosts, we wish you no harm.{/i}"
    BLACK "{i}我々の賓客です、危害を加えるつもりはありません。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:100
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_7c963290:

    # MC @ talk "How... How can we hear you?"
    MC @ talk "どうやって…どうやってあなたの声が聞こえるの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:101
translate ja qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_08ff171f:

